{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/113799-supernatural-contracts","id":113799,"title":"Supernatural Contracts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-15T21:01:05-07:00","id":113799,"title":"Supernatural Contracts","content":"I was reading the Equinox Roads and the parts about making Contracts made me think of something. Let's say that Changelings know about the other denizens of the WoD. Since part of making a Contract is making a pledge with a facet of reality, can Changelings make pledges with facets of reality that are attuned with other supernaturals? Can they make a pledge with Vitae when dealing with the Kindred? Can they pledge with the Underworld? Atlantean reality? Reading about Prometheans and their inability with the Hedge seems to suggest that the Created can be helped if a Changeling can make a pledge with the Divine Fire.<br /> <br /> What facets of supernatural reality can Changelings make Contracts with, and what kind?<br /> <br /> I'm curious. Please tell me the possibilities as it relates to Kindred, Uratha, Awakened, Created, Arisen, and Unchained.<br /> <br /> I'm leaving Hunters out because one, the majority of them are mortal and two, Hunters are too diverse to focus a specified Contract, IMHO. Plus, there's Mortal Remains, so they may have something about this.<br /> <br /> Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-15T21:25:20-07:00","id":113816,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JackalopeVegas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/113799-supernatural-contracts#post113799\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Atlantean reality?</div> </div> </div> </div>You mean Supernal Realms. One of obvious mistakes people mke about Awakening gameline is that magic is <b>from</b> Atlantis, not first made <b>in</b> Atlantis ( and even, truly, it's many diffrent &quot;mythical lands&quot; before to begin with ). Magic comes from Supernal Realms, platonic ideals realms &quot;above&quot; our world. &quot;Atlantis&quot; was a place were it was just first studied and made in to kind of science.<br /> <br /> There is Arcadia Realm that maybe is, maybe not Changling's Arcadaia to begin with. If yes - you have all Contracs you need with it.<br /> <br /> As to general &quot;can I Contract Supernal Realms&quot; I would say - <b>No</b>. The Lost can't made contract with something they don't percive, and they can't expirance any Supernal Realm if it isn't Arcadia. I could see Contracts of Shadow Realm and Underworld of Fallen World, but not Supernal Realms itself. Even in Mage they are very questionable, they could be just melenia old wizards histeria, for all we know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-16T07:25:56-07:00","id":114047,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JackalopeVegas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/113799-supernatural-contracts#post113799\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What facets of supernatural reality can Changelings make Contracts with, and what kind?<br /> <br /> I'm curious. Please tell me the possibilities as it relates to Kindred, Uratha, Awakened, Created, Arisen, and Unchained.</div> </div> </div> </div> As with all things crossover, they can do pretty much anything and everything your ST wants to.<br /> <br /> That said... Wizened have super tools, akin to God-Machine's super science. There's at least two Contracts that can talk to and manipulate spirits. There are vampy mind control powers and issues with mirrors.<br /> <br /> The question becomes, what is there left to do that hasn't already been done? We already have power sets that relate to most of the themes of other games. The only thing that really remains that I can think of is &quot;set of contracts that let you facilitate crossover better.&quot; A Contract of Aether would let you deal directly with aether / pyros, see gears, and do God Machine stuff. Contract of Shadows would be a deal with the strix (not vitae) and deal with vampires, giving you predatory aura, etc.<br /> <br /> So, that's all I can think of. Set of stuff that makes you even more like another supernatural, a mimicry of the race's innate abilities.<br /> <br /> <br /> EDIT - oh, and...<br /> Shadows for vampires / blood bathers<br /> Aether for demons and prommies<br /> Word for mages / mummies<br /> Spirit for werewolves / purified<br /> Death for more Sin-Eater stuff, though not how much more you need, with Shade","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","user":"MCN","date":". 04-16-2014, 10:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}